## Runs on, but does not contain

NullMoth's NVIDIA driver for macOS (<https://github.com/nullmoth/nvidia-macos-driver>) is licensed under
PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0. **No code or binary from it is included in this repository.** The plug-ins
here are loaded by that driver through its documented extension points (`libnvdec_h264.dylib` next to the
driver, `NVMTL_NVENCVT` for the encoder), and `install.sh` copies them into an existing driver
installation. Running the driver at all also requires that project's own licence terms.

The video plug-ins that the driver ships are prebuilt from mickys/nvenc; this repository does not
redistribute them. `install.sh` only ever *backs up* the file it replaces.

